// BT-4001: a class-side `super` send in an Object subclass's class method, at
// method level and inside a closure.

Bt4001ClassSuperObjectBase subclass: Bt4001ClassSuperObjectChild

  class peek: x => x

  class run => super peek: 1

  class runAll => #(1, 2) collect: [:x | super peek: x]
